+2.  **Mesh Generation Phase**: Traverse the octree. If node is full, add a single cube mesh for the node's bounding box. If leaf (res=2), iterate 8 children; if child mask bit is set, add a unit cube mesh at the child's offset. If inner node, iterate 8 children; if child mask bit is set, recursively traverse child node at offset + index [S1, unofficial].
